3. Return the name of the car size.

Here's the code implementation in JavaScript:

```javascript
const carSizes = {
  compact: {
    name: "Compact",
    heightRange: "4'6\" - 5'2\"",
    length: "14 - 16 feet"
  },
  midsize: {
    name: "Midsize",
    heightRange: "5'3\" - 5'5\"",
    length: "16 - 18 feet"
  },
  fullsize: {
    name: "Fullsize",
