```

2. Create an instance of the AEAD GCM cipher class:

```java
Aead aead = new AeadSpi() {
    @Override
    public void init(AeadParameters parameters) {
        super.init(parameters);
        // Set the secret key and initialization vector (IV)
        SecretKeySpec secretKeySpec = new SecretKeySpec((byte[]) parameters.getParameter("secretKey"), "AES");
        setSecretKey(secretKeySpec);
        setIV((byte[]) parameters.getParameter("iv"));
    }

    @Override
    public byte[] encrypt(byte[] plaintext) {
        // Encrypt the plaintext using the AEAD GCM algorithm
